"""Tests for {{ device_name }} device.

Test Techniques Used:
- Specification-based Testing: device handler registration
- Integration Testing: full lifecycle via AppHarness

See:
  • cosalette ai help testing — testing strategies and clock control
  • ADR-007 — testing strategy decisions

IMPORTANT: Never patch time.monotonic, asyncio.sleep, or time.sleep globally.
asyncio uses these internally. Global patches corrupt loop timing — in Python
3.14+ this causes an infinite loop or asyncio.timeout failure before your
production code even runs. Use ctx.sleep() in device coroutines and inject
FakeClock via AppHarness.
"""

